---
import StudioFrame from '../../components/StudioFrame.astro';
---
<StudioFrame title="登录会员谱坊" description="以会员号进入你的私密相册家谱。">
  <section class="studio-card studio-login" data-studio-login>
    <span class="eyebrow">MEMBER ACCESS / 会员入口</span>
    <h2>从这一页，回到你的家谱。</h2>
    <p>使用学会发出的会员号和初始密码登录。第一次进入后，系统会请你设置自己的密码。</p>
    <p class="studio-note">Use the Society-issued member ID and password to enter your private Photo Genealogy.</p>
    <form data-studio-login-form>
      <label>会员号 <small>Member ID</small><input name="memberId" autocomplete="username" placeholder="R1001" required /></label>
      <label>密码 <small>Password</small><input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required /></label>
      <p class="studio-note">登录后会在本设备持续保持会话；请只在自己的设备上使用。</p>
      <button class="button" type="submit">进入我的相册家谱</button>
    </form>
    <p class="studio-status" aria-live="polite" data-studio-status></p>
    <p class="studio-help">忘记密码或账户尚未开通，请用 WhatsApp 9272 8933 联络学会。</p>
  </section>
</StudioFrame>
<script>
  import '../../scripts/studio-login';
</script>
